                <pb facs="0973" n="867" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg867"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Guatemalan Minister of Foreign
                    Affairs.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-10-22"><hi rendition="#italic">October 22,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Death of Minister Muñoz has occasioned deep sorrow and sympathy. Secretario
                    Bengoechea received this morning as chargé interim.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Root.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
